# Requiem of Sin (otherAreas 83): Tavnazian Safehold's Despachiaire (no script, default 106) and Boneyard Gully's
# battlefield 678 (entry _081, index 6; its own checkRequirements: the Letter from Shikaree Y or the Letter from the
# Mithran Trackers, no quest status). Tango with a Tracker completed (a GM); a fresh CoP log (no mission reply).
# NextConquestTally() is 1800198000. Despachiaire (the wait 0, Prog 0): 578, finished: the letter Y, the wait
# 1800198000, Prog 1; again: nil, 106; again with the wait 0 (a GM; Prog 1 alone keeps it off): nil, 106; the wait back
# (a GM). The battlefield entered: begun, the letter spent; won by bfwin (the three Shikarees' deaths open an Armoury
# Crate, whose trigger sets the win with a 5-tick exit delay that no flow step reached), 32001 (battlefieldWin 678),
# finished: completed (Disciple of Justice). Completed, the wait = the tally: no section, 106. Three JST days on: 579,
# finished: the Letter from the Mithran Trackers, the wait 1800802800; again: no section, 106.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/578 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/579 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TangoWithATracker completed
login
trigger Despachiaire                    # available, the wait 0, Prog 0: 578
finish                                  # the letter Y; the wait 1800198000; Prog 1
trigger Despachiaire                    # Prog 1: nil; 106
finish
charvar ShikareeBattleWait 0            # a GM
trigger Despachiaire                    # Prog 1, the wait below the tally: nil; 106
finish
charvar ShikareeBattleWait 1800198000   # a GM: back to the tally
warp -617.9,-1.5,505.7 BoneyardGully
trigger _081                            # the letter: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=97                  # index 6, area 1: Requiem of Sin (678)
finish                                  # in 678: begun; the letter spent
bfwin                                   # a GM: won; 32001
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 678: completed
warp 112.7,-40,-85.5 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Despachiaire                    # completed, the wait = the tally: no section; 106
finish
wait jst=3                              # Monday: the tally 1800802800
trigger Despachiaire                    # 579
finish                                  # the Mithran Trackers' letter; the wait 1800802800
trigger Despachiaire                    # the wait = the tally: no section; 106
finish
